## 120-minute session sketch

```text
00–15  I.0 reminder or quick ontology on the sample image
15–40  Walk steps 1–4 live (describe → forms → origin)
40–65  Steps 5–8 + critical + circulation (Lens A/B on board)
65–100 Lab: two students or pairs fill the 8-step card
100–120 Share one critical finding + one circulation claim; save to portfolio
```

